{
  "$comment": "Relay Test-it probe. The sheet sends at most two requests through the relay with the openai_images route: generate with spec.requests.generate, then — only when the edit option is ticked and generate passed — edit with spec.requests.edit on the generated image. Each step yields status ok | failed | cancelled (user tapped stop), the response kind (url | b64 | data_url from the response parser), the decoded width / height and the wall-clock elapsedMs measured by the sheet. cases lock the pure evaluation: per-row text parts, the verdict (both | generateOnly | cannotGenerate | cancelled) and what happens to the stored probe profile (write = save expect.profile for this connection + model id, remove = delete any stored one, keep = leave it). The stored profile is device-local (not synced, not in backups) and is fed to the resolver as the relay connection-level profile (image_profile_resolution relay.relay_probe_result). failed rows show studio.relayTest.result.failed with the errorKind title; skipped rows show studio.relayTest.result.skipped. Probe images never become works. Executable reference: scripts/lib/studio-relay-probe-reference.mjs.",
  "contractId": "studio_relay_probe.v1",
  "version": 1,
  "spec": {
    "requests": {
      "generate": {
        "route": "openai_images",
        "prompt": "A red apple on a white table",
        "size": "1024x1024",
        "quality": "low",
        "n": 1
      },
      "edit": {
        "route": "openai_images",
        "editTransport": "multipart",
        "prompt": "Make the apple green",
        "size": "1024x1024",
        "quality": "low",
        "n": 1,
        "image": "the generate result"
      }
    },
    "costText": "$0.01–0.02",
    "kindLabels": {
      "url": "URL",
      "b64": "Base64",
      "data_url": "Data URL"
    },
    "rules": [
      "A step passes only with at least one image whose decoded width and height are both > 0; otherwise it fails with errorKind decode_failed.",
      "Edit is sent only when ticked and generate passed; otherwise its row (when ticked) is skipped. Unticked edit has no row.",
      "Any cancelled step: verdict cancelled, store keep, no profile.",
      "Generate not passed: verdict cannotGenerate, store remove.",
      "Generate passed: store write; edit passed gives both with edit operations, else generateOnly.",
      "Row seconds = max(1, round half up of elapsedMs / 1000); running clock = m:ss of floor seconds.",
      "verifiedAt = UTC calendar date of now."
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "both_pass_urlThenB64",
      "input": {
        "editSelected": true,
        "generate": {
          "status": "ok",
          "kind": "url",
          "width": 1024,
          "height": 1024,
          "elapsedMs": 31200
